**Source:** arc42.md §7.1 Despliegue local inicial

**Purpose:** Shows the initial local deployment: a single user machine running the browser (localhost:5173), the frontend, FastAPI (8000), PostgreSQL (5432), Redis (6379), and a CPU worker under Docker Compose/local processes, plus the GPU worker (host or CUDA container), local volumes for storage, and a separate models/weights directory. Browser reaches the frontend; the frontend reaches the API; the API reaches PostgreSQL, Redis, and storage; Redis reaches CPU and GPU workers; workers reach storage; the GPU worker reaches models.
